 "brief": "Israeli occupation forces stormed the town of Silwad northeast of Ramallah on Wednesday and raided the mourning house of martyr Farah Ahmad Hamed, Shehab Wire reported. The raid occurred as troops deployed tear gas canisters against those gathered at the residence.\n\nHamed was killed in Gaza. The operation targeted the family's home during the mourning period, when relatives and community members typically gather to pay respects to the deceased. Israeli forces have conducted similar raids on homes of Palestinians killed in military operations, particularly in occupied West Bank towns.",
